  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "We apply the options on the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nGiven equation: 28 - 28 ÷ 14 + 7 × 2 = 16\n\nChecking the options, after interchanging the symbols:\n\nOption 1) × and -\n\n28 × __**28 ÷ 14**__ + 7 - 2 = 16\n\n__**28 **____**× **2__ + 7 - 2 = 16\n\n__**56 + 7**__ - 2 = 16\n\n__**63 - 2**__ = 16\n\n61 ≠ 16\n\nOption 2) + and ÷\n\n28 - 28 + __**14 ÷ 7**__ × 2 = 16\n\n28 - 28 + __**2**____** ×**____** 2**__ = 16\n\n__**28**__ - 28 __**+ 4**__ = 16\n\n__**32 - 28**__ = 16\n\n4 ≠ 16\n\nOption 3) × and ÷\n\n28 - 28 × 14 + __**7 ÷ 2**__ = 16\n\n28 - __**28 × 14**__ + 3.5 = 16\n\n__**28**__ - 392 __**+ **____**3.5**__ = 16\n\n__**31.5 - 392**__ = 16\n\n-360.5 ≠ 16\n\n**Option 4) + and -**\n\n28 + __**28 ÷ 14**__ - 7 × 2 = 16\n\n28 + 2 - __**7 × 2**__ = 16\n\n__**28 + 2**__ - 14 = 16\n\n__**30 - 14**__ = 16\n\n**16 = 16**\n\nHence the correct answer is **option 4)**",
